<title>USA: Allied Healthcare names chief executive.</title>
<headline>Allied Healthcare names chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Healthcare Products Inc said Tuesday it appointed Uma Nandan Aggarwal as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Aggarwal succeeds James Janning, who will continue to serve on the company's board of directors. He is returning to his position as president and chief executive for Harbour Group Ltd, Allied said.</p>
<p>Aggarwal most recently served as president and general manager of Mail Media Cos, a division of Stanley Works.     --Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
